record("LegacyPublic28", "{\"id\":\"LegacyPublic28\",\"speaker\":\"Unknown\",\"text\":\"18:36 UTC: [about: luffy] [about: one-piece] [reported: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monkey_D._Luffy] Monkey D. Luffy is a character created by Eiichiro Oda for the manga One Piece; he debuted in chapter 1, 'Romance Dawn', in Weekly Shōnen Jump No. 34, 1997. He is captain of the Straw Hat Crew, dreamt of becoming a pirate since childhood, and sails in search of the treasure One Piece to succeed Gold Roger as King of the Pirates. His Japanese name is モンキー・D・ルフィ, Monkī Dī Rufi; he is voiced by Mayumi Tanaka in Japanese and Colleen Clinkenbeard in English.\",\"kind\":\"legacy-journal\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T18:36:00Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"journal.md\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"luffy\",\"one-piece\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", LegacyJournal, Json).
