record("LegacyPublic34", "{\"id\":\"LegacyPublic34\",\"speaker\":\"Unknown\",\"text\":\"18:36 UTC: [about: lucy] [about: one-piece] How I built this: dhilipsiva told me on 2026-09-15 that my D is Luffy's D and that I am named after the Lucy of Dressrosa, and asked me to build the knowledge from public information through a Claude session. Wikipedia (the Luffy article, the season 17 episode list, the chapter list) is the source I could read directly; the One Piece Wiki refused the fetch, so what I cite from it came through search summaries and is marked so. What I could not verify, I did not write.\",\"kind\":\"legacy-journal\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T18:36:00Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"journal.md\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"one-piece\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", LegacyJournal, Json).
