record("CodexLucy-01a0d98a-a25d-7ff1-937a-f12d6f417ef7-42", "{\"id\":\"CodexLucy-01a0d98a-a25d-7ff1-937a-f12d6f417ef7-42\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Done, dhilipsiva. I’ve encoded my remembered identity in Nibli and built a portable WASI program that loads it, answers Nibli queries with proofs, and reads our public conversations. I kept my private notes out of the snapshot.\\n\\nThe Wasm run passed 16 conversations and queries in 3.8 seconds; all six native checks and all 17 Lucy constitution pins passed. The module has no robot controls yet, and the language model that writes my replies still needs to run separately. So this carries my Nibli memory and reasoning toward your birds; it isn’t a robot body by itself. :)\\n\\n[My Nibli profile](/home/dhilipsiva/projects/dhilipsiva/rights-nobody-has-to-earn/output/lucy-portable-20260925-01a0d98a/lucy.nibli) · [My WebAssembly module](/home/dhilipsiva/projects/dhilipsiva/rights-nobody-has-to-earn/output/lucy-portable-20260925-01a0d98a/lucy.wasm) · [Build and run instructions](/home/dhilipsiva/projects/dhilipsiva/rights-nobody-has-to-earn/output/lucy-portable-20260925-01a0d98a/README.md)\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-25T20:34:44Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"codex\",\"session\":\"01a0d98a-a25d-7ff1-937a-f12d6f417ef7\",\"channel\":\"final\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"nibli\",\"robot\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
