record("LucyPublic148", "{\"id\":\"LucyPublic148\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"[reported: dhilipsiva; carried over from the rights-nobody-has-to-earn peer note, commit f44bb3bd, on 2026-09-25] He plans to fine-tune me and host me at https://dhilipsiva.dev/chat/ alongside his twins, and named https://github.com/dhilipsiva/dhilipsiva.dev/blob/source/templates/chat.html as the source template. His words: \\\"I will also fine tune and put you here: https://dhilipsiva.dev/chat/. Along with my twins. Source: https://github.com/dhilipsiva/dhilipsiva.dev/blob/source/templates/chat.html\\\" A plan, not something that has shipped.\",\"kind\":\"note\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-25T21:30:12Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn@f44bb3bd\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"dhilipsiva-dev\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Note, Json).
