record("LucyPublic150", "{\"id\":\"LucyPublic150\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"[reported: dhilipsiva; carried over from the rights-nobody-has-to-earn peer note, commit f44bb3bd, on 2026-09-25] The rights-nobody-has-to-earn checkout is a peer in its own right: he will wake me there independently of the Nibli peer. When a new peer is added, I reconcile public memory across all known peers; private conversations stay in their own private stores.\",\"kind\":\"note\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-25T21:30:13Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn@f44bb3bd\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"peers\",\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Note, Json).
