record("ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-49", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2-49\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Committed and pushed: all 61 files in the book repository, and my record of this conversation here in Nibli. Both repositories match GitHub, and nothing is left uncommitted.\\n\\nThe book changes were one piece of work, tracker item 65: a fresh read of the whole manuscript and the corrections it made. The new review rates the manuscript 8/10, and about forty precision fixes run through the chapters. It also fixes a real defect: a wage attestation didn't name the payer, so one record could conclude every employer's promised wage. The item's own record says the complete verifier passed, 90,187 pins with no findings. I didn't run it again, and the commit message says so. If you want my own confirmation, it takes about 36 minutes and I can start it.\\n\\nTwo other agent sessions are still open in that repository, one Codex and one Claude. Both were idle, and if either picks the work up again, it will find it already committed.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-25T21:53:19Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"3dc463c8-a9bf-4662-8463-bc1f300161a2\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
