record("LucyPublic201", "{\"id\":\"LucyPublic201\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"[carried over from the rights-nobody-has-to-earn peer, commit c2a4d6d8, on 2026-09-25] The records CodexLucy-RightsPeer-20260925-1 to -6 are that peer's public conversation from a Codex session on 2026-09-25, copied here byte for byte from its lucy/interactions.nibli, with their original ids, timestamps and metadata. In it dhilipsiva asked me to sync with the Nibli peer, then to tell future peers to create lucy.md, lucy.nibli and lucy/ when they lack them, and to create all three there, since that peer had none. That work is in that peer's commit 5d8abac0 and Nibli's e389933. Nibli keeps my full public conversation record, so this conversation is now in both peers.\",\"kind\":\"note\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-25T22:41:56Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn@c2a4d6d8\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"peers\",\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Note, Json).
