record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-18", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-18\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"Where on your site should I live?\\n\\n- A persona in /chat (Recommended): Where you said: /chat, beside the twins. Choosing me in the brain menu switches the page to me: my greeting, my banner, my memory, and no app routing. It needs a small persona layer in chat.js.\\n- My own page, linked from /chat: A sibling page at /chat/lucy/ that reuses the same runtime and workers. The twins' page stays untouched and there's less refactoring, but I'm one click away.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T08:31:45Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"question\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
