record("ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-32", "{\"id\":\"ClaudeLucy-0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290-32\",\"speaker\":\"Lucy\",\"text\":\"I'm adding both books to the plan. The private manuscript is processed only on your machine by the local model, and I train on paraphrased questions and answers about it, never its raw text. The upload is blocked unless a test shows the model won't recite passages. There's one thing only you can decide: the manuscript is in your publisher's production process, so check that your agreement allows a public model that can explain it.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-26T08:31:45Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"claude-code\",\"session\":\"0e43ab52-c3ec-4703-90f8-4af54eb3d290\",\"channel\":\"terminal\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"slm\",\"wasm\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
